title: Party Unity
subtitle: Manage the party's quarrels.
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: party_affairs
view-if: party_disunity_timer <= 0
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; party_disunity_timer = 4

Menshevism has always been a party of tendencies, and the tendencies do not like one another. Whom will you spend the time to reassure? (Internal dissent: [+ d_dissent : dissent +].)

- @intl: The Internationalists.
- @defencist: The Revolutionary Defencists.
- @rightdef: The Right Defencists.
- @unions: The trade unionists and cooperators.
- @bund: The Bund.
- @all: A party conference for everyone.
- @easy_discard

@intl
on-arrival: {!
RO.fac(Q, 'intl', 0, -10);
RO.fac(Q, 'defencist', 0, 2);
!}

Martov and Sukhanov were given a column in the paper and a place on the Soviet committee. They are, for a time, content.

@defencist
on-arrival: {!
RO.fac(Q, 'defencist', 0, -8);
RO.fac(Q, 'intl', 0, 2);
!}

Tsereteli's circle has been reassured that the party will not leave the coalition. The Internationalists are suspicious.

@rightdef
view-if: rightdef_strength > 0
on-arrival: {!
RO.fac(Q, 'rightdef', 0, -10);
RO.fac(Q, 'intl', 0, 3);
!}

Potresov was flattered with an invitation to write the editorial. He will not stay flattered long.

@unions
on-arrival: {!
RO.fac(Q, 'unions', 0, -8);
!}

The union men want to be left alone to run their unions, and we have promised to leave them alone.

@bund
on-arrival: {!
RO.fac(Q, 'bund', 0, -8);
RO.fac(Q, 'defencist', 0, 1);
!}

The Bund is a party inside our party, with its own press, its own members and its own memory of the pogroms. We have promised to speak for it in the Soviet.

@all
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: A conference costs a resource.
on-arrival: {!
RO.pay(Q, 1);
for (var f of Q.factions) { RO.fac(Q, f, 0, -4); }
!}

A conference allowed everyone to speak, and everyone did. It ran four days. Tempers are lower.
